ERA5 provenance and upstream rights
---------------------------------
These data are derived from ERA5, produced by ECMWF for the Copernicus Climate
Change Service (C3S), using the DKRZ E5 P1D archive. The processing includes
spatial binning, temporal summaries, scientific diagnostics, and selections
described in ../README.md and manifest.csv. The original ERA5 GRIB archive is
not included. No ownership of the original ERA5 products is claimed here.
Underlying ERA5 rights and applicable Copernicus terms are retained; this
CC BY 4.0 notice does not replace those terms or the required source credit.

Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information 2026.
The European Commission and ECMWF are not responsible for use of these data.

Copernicus terms and attribution:
https://apps.ecmwf.int/datasets/licences/copernicus/
DKRZ ERA5 distribution and attribution guidance:
https://www.dkrz.de/en/communication/news-archive/datacollections

Retain the Copernicus attribution and disclaimer when redistributing these
derived data. The repository's MIT license applies to code and associated
documentation, not to these processed-data files.
